{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1748","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Circular Xor Reversal"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have an array $$$a_0, a_1, \\ldots, a_{n-1}$$$ of length $$$n$$$. Initially, $$$a_i = 2^i$$$ for all $$$0 \\le i \\lt n$$$. Note that array $$$a$$$ is zero-indexed. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You want to reverse this array (that is, make $$$a_i$$$ equal to $$$2^{n-1-i}$$$ for all $$$0 \\le i \\lt n$$$). To do this, you can perform the following operation no more than $$$250\\,000$$$ times:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Select an integer $$$i$$$ ($$$0 \\le i \\lt n$$$) and replace $$$a_i$$$ by $$$a_i \\oplus a_{(i+1)\\bmod n}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here, $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sequence of operations that will result in the array $$$a$$$ being reversed. It can be shown that under the given constraints, a solution always exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 400$$$) — the length of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the first line print one integer $$$k$$$ ($$$0 \\le k \\le 250\\,000$$$) — the number of operations performed."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the second line print $$$k$$$ integers $$$i_1,i_2,\\ldots,i_k$$$ ($$$0 \\le i_j \\lt n$$$). Here, $$$i_j$$$ should be the integer selected on the $$$j$$$-th operation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that you don't need to minimize the number of operations."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1 0 1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\n1 0 1 0 2 1 0 1 0 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the notes, the elements on which the operations are performed are colored red."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, array $$$a$$$ will change in the following way: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[1,\\color{red}{2}] \\rightarrow [\\color{red}{1},3] \\rightarrow [2,\\color{red}{3}] \\rightarrow [2,1]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, array $$$a$$$ will change in the following way:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[1,\\color{red}{2},4] \\rightarrow [\\color{red}{1},6,4] \\rightarrow [7,\\color{red}{6},4] \\rightarrow [\\color{red}{7},2,4] \\rightarrow [5,2,\\color{red}{4}] \\rightarrow [5,\\color{red}{2},1] \\rightarrow [\\color{red}{5},3,1] \\rightarrow [6,\\color{red}{3},1] \\rightarrow [\\color{red}{6},2,1] \\rightarrow [4,2,1]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1748F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1748/problem/F"}